TITLE Pyrite oxidation in pure water with atmospheric O2
SOLUTION 1
    temp 25
    pH 7.0
    units mol/kgw
    water 1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    O2(g) -0.7 10
    Pyrite 0 0.1
    Goethite 0 10
    Gypsum 0 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.out
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
USER_PUNCH
    -headings SC
10 PUNCH SC
END
